Gold Arena!guide_training_main_first_enter_1x欢迎来到竞技场！首先我们从训练开始，学会如何像高手一样战斗。点击训练进入训练场。_Welcome to the arena! Start with training and learn to fight like a pro. Tap Training to enter.guide_training_battle_first_1?训练之前先选择一把趁手的武器，点击这把剑。&Choose a weapon first. Tap this sword.guide_training_battle_first_2Z这里看到武器属性，目前我们不用过多在意。点击装备，把剑拿上。=These are weapon stats. For now, tap Equip to take the sword.guide_training_battle_first_3?武器已经准备好了。点击战斗开始第一场训练。2Your weapon is ready. Tap Fight to start training.guide_training_battle_first_4'拖动左下角摇杆向敌人靠近。+Drag the joystick to move toward the enemy.guide_training_battle_first_5K进入剑的攻击范围后，角色会自动攻击，注意攻击动作。GMove into sword range to attack automatically. Watch the attack motion.guide_training_battle_first_6N每次攻击都会消耗体力，体力会自己回复，但别用的太快。JAttacks cost stamina. It recovers over time, but do not spend it too fast.guide_training_battle_first_7W干得不错，现在敌人会开始移动和攻击。继续进攻，赢下第一场。ENice work. The enemy will now move and attack. Keep fighting and win.guide_training_battle_second_1]一场战斗结束后会有重新选择武器的机会，但现在我们先继续下一场。@After each battle, you can pick a new weapon. For now, continue.guide_training_battle_second_3T你很有战斗天赋，现在该教你格挡了，这是很有效的反击手段。BYou have talent. Now learn to block, a great way to counterattack.guide_training_battle_second_4v消耗8点体力使用格挡，被敌人攻击时可以减少一些伤害，并让对方无法行动。点击格挡。KBlocking costs 8 stamina. It reduces damage and stuns the enemy. Tap Block.guide_training_battle_second_5K武器会因为耐久度耗尽而碎裂，没有武器就无法进攻了。LWeapons break when durability runs out. Without a weapon, you cannot attack.guide_training_battle_second_6Z往后退到场地边缘，那里应该已经扔进来了新的武器，赶紧拿上吧。FMove back to the arena edge. A new weapon should be there. Pick it up.guide_training_battle_third_1<现在我们有新的装备了，点击小盾查看详情。2You got new gear. Tap the buckler to view details.guide_training_battle_third_2H小盾可以在格挡时减少更多的伤害，点击装备穿上它。HThe light shield reduces more damage when blocking. Tap Equip to use it.guide_training_battle_third_3H点击战斗进入最后的训练，你将面对一场完整的战斗。0Tap Fight for the final training: a full battle.guide_training_battle_third_4~现在战斗有时间限制了，在时限内用刚才学到的战胜敌人吧。不过这是训练，不用担心会失败。kBattles now have a time limit. Use what you learned to win. This is training, so do not worry about losing.guide_training_battle_matching��恭喜你完成所有训练！接下来匹配真实对手，战斗，并获取奖励提升装备和角色吧。祝你玩得开心！sTraining complete! Now match with real opponents, fight, and earn rewards to upgrade gear and characters. Have fun!guide_task_move靠近敌人Approach the Enemyguide_task_hit击中敌人 {0}/{1}Hit Enemy {0}/{1}guide_task_block格挡成功 {0}/{1}Successful Blocks {0}/{1}guide_task_kill击败敌人Defeat Enemyguide_task_pickWeapon拾取武器Pick Up Weaponguide_arena_name	训练营Training Campequip_name_1012匕首Daggerequip_name_1013匕首Daggerequip_name_1014匕首Daggerequip_name_1022剑Swordequip_name_1023剑Swordequip_name_1024剑Swordequip_name_1032斧头Axeequip_name_1033斧头Axeequip_name_1034斧头Axeequip_name_1042锤Hammerequip_name_1043锤Hammerequip_name_1044锤Hammerequip_name_1052长矛Spearequip_name_1053长矛Spearequip_name_1054长矛Spearequip_name_2012小盾Light Shieldequip_name_2013小盾Light Shieldequip_name_2014小盾Light Shieldequip_name_2022中盾Shieldequip_name_2023中盾Shieldequip_name_2024中盾Shieldrole_name_1轻甲角斗士Leorole_name_2重甲角斗士Brutus